        { "visual": "Hito 9 cubrió: Past Continuous (I was working). Past Continuous vs Past Simple (I was typing when he called). Adverbios de modo (efficiently, quickly, well, fast, hard).", "audio": "Milestone nine covered: Past Continuous like I was working. Past Continuous versus Past Simple like I was typing when he called. And adverbs of manner like efficiently, quickly, and well." },
        { "visual": "También: Equipo de oficina (printer, stapler) e Imperativos (Press the button, Don't unplug). Preposiciones de dirección (to, from, into). Verbos con to (want to, need to) y verbos con -ing (enjoy working). Y viajes (flight, boarding pass).", "audio": "Also: Office equipment and imperatives like Press the button. Prepositions of direction. Verbs with 'to' like want to, and verbs with I-N-G like enjoy working. And business travel vocabulary." }
